            lines+=['','Each row binds its own complete archive, measured fidelity and actual direct execution. Timing aggregates the same four prompt/forcing conditions but fresh processes ran at different times; use raw condition-level samples for comparisons. Serialized factor precision differs from resident FP32 contraction copies, which erode the core codec’s memory advantage. No matched-quality or vendor-optimal claim follows.','']
