        lines+=['','These are one-GPU projection/decoding costs without communication. Fixed initial SVD bases and constant repeated gradients limit generality; an error-feedback residual cannot recover an always-discarded subspace without basis refresh. Actual backing-storage bytes, refresh costs/rounds and full-model payloads are recorded. The SVD basis slice retains the full U backing storage; logical rank8 basis coefficients/broadcast are8192 bytes for this256x256 case, separately from262144 bytes of retained storage. Native/DDP aggregation equality and one optimizer update are independent correctness results, not distributed speed.',evidence(path/'distributed.json'),'']
